 "text": "Hi! How's everything with you? Kind of yes. Eye strain is real, especially since you use a laptop. Try taking short breaks every half hour or so. It adds up. A quick five minute break every hour is even more effective. Dimming it a bit helps a lot. About halfway between brightest and dark is the most relaxing. If they help, keep them. Many people do need them. As for your eyes being tired, a full eye test to see where you' nearsighted or not is always good, especially if you' over thirty.",
